# Meld / Warps: the internal carrier cross-modulated by what comes in on J2;
# LEVEL 2 (the modulator) to 0 changes the output.
wait 3500
pot 3 0.8                  # LEVEL 1
pot 4 0.8                  # LEVEL 2
sing 220
wait 1500
mark
wait 500
expect rms > 0.02
expect finite
pot 4 0.0
wait 1500
mark
wait 500
print rms
